        447.5486145019531,
        513.4932861328125,
        460.4626159667969
      ],
      "text": "2.\t For people with bacteriologically confirmed TB, low-complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        463.0486145019531,
        513.3461303710938,
        475.9626159667969
      ],
      "text": "NAATs should be used on respiratory samples as initial tests for detection of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        478.5486145019531,
        389.5706787109375,
        491.4626159667969
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifampicin rather than culture-based DST.",
