      "size": 10.964292526245117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        603.5201416015625,
        392.1004943847656,
        616.6651611328125
      ],
      "text": "induced sputum, nasopharyngeal aspirate and gastric aspirate.",
