      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        619.0201416015625,
        526.9532470703125,
        632.1651611328125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation was extrapolated to people with extrapulmonary TB based on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
