        70.86620330810547,
        720.292236328125,
        526.241943359375,
        729.8662719726562
      ],
      "text": "5\t Having a positive result of a test, examination or other procedure used to distinguish people with a high likelihood of having",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        731.3062744140625,
        526.25146484375,
        740.8662719726562
      ],
      "text": "TB disease from people who are highly unlikely to have TB. At present, the following tests are WHO-recommended as the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        742.3062744140625,
        526.2022705078125,
        751.8662719726562
      ],
